lberds for the guard, every day. Something's coming down from the mountains, and his lordship wants steel waiting.","Dunmere's smiths make pretty swords. Mine make widows."],"via":"grimhold-barracks"},{"id":"gravedigger","role":"Gravedigger","wander":[304.0,972.8,480,1075.2],"chore":"dig","night":"away","says":["I dig them, the necromancer undigs them. Steady work.","That one there? Dug him three times. Stubborn."],"via":"grimhold-barracks"},{"id":"stablehand","role":"Stablehand","night":"away","post":[403.2,595.2],"facing":"down","says":"The horses won't go near the north wall at night. Neither will I.","via":"grimhold-barracks"},{"id":"maid","role":"Maidservant","night":"away","wander":[576,656.0,976.0,976.0],"says":"Eyes down, mouth shut, and you live long in Grimhold. Mostly.","via":"grimhold-keep"},{"id":"spy","role":"Hooded stranger","post":[1171.2,1068.8],"facing":"left","says":"Dunmere sends its regards? Dunmere sends spies. I'd know. I'm one of theirs."},{"id":"mercenary","role":"Mercenary","night":"away","wander":[1056,880.0,1264.0,992],"says":"Gold's good in Grimhold. The company, less so. The food, worst of all.","via":"grimhold-barracks"}],"facing":"up","breaks":[{"thing":29,"solid":[[1264,554,1308,576]]},{"thing":30,"solid":[[1213,950,1256,972]]},{"thing":31,"solid":[[582,701,607,723]]},{"thing":32,"solid":[[928,701,953,723]]},{"thing":33,"solid":[[512,963,537,985]]}],"lights":[[684,1305,"torch"],[851,1305,"torch"],[691,1052,"torch"],[844,1052,"torch"],[576,464.0,"window"],[768,464.0,"window"],[960,464.0,"window"],[713,630,"torch"],[822,630,"torch"],[336,808,"window"],[496,808,"window"],[1040,733,"window"],[1136,733,"window"],[1232,733,"window"],[1040,792,"window"],[1232,792,"window"],[364,915,"campfire"]],"water":"#28302f"}